{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aiyana woke up in a forest with her memory gone. </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/5114eb1ede2181abe2d6c74886259ee1.poster.avif?t=1709694301\" width=676 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/5114eb1ede2181abe2d6c74886259ee1.webm?t=1709694301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/5114eb1ede2181abe2d6c74886259ee1.mp4?t=1709694301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Florarium is a bow action-adventure game. Master the bow in the unique world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engaging Battle</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Battle against challenging bosses. <br></li><li>Find and upgrade skills to match your playstyle.<br></li><li>Fast-paced ranged battle without the need to aim.<br></li><li>Test your limit in the underground colosseum. </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/23fd9747d5b0ed59b53fd4fa832610d1.poster.avif?t=1709694301\" width=672 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/23fd9747d5b0ed59b53fd4fa832610d1.webm?t=1709694301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/23fd9747d5b0ed59b53fd4fa832610d1.mp4?t=1709694301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475080/extras/76e237083626b6c0a84470814b8ca498.poster.avif?t=1709694301\" width=624 height=242 ><source src=\"https:/